.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH soundcraft-cli-app 1  "app " 
.SH NAME
soundcraft\-cli\-app \- Call a running app\*(Aqs control channel
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsoundcraft\-cli app\fR [\fB\-\-port\fR] [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIMETHOD\fR> [\fIJSON\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Call a running app\*(Aqs control channel
.PP
A dotted engine command id is shorthand for engine.execute; the control methods (session.inspect, ui.screenshot, …) stay methods. Prints the reply as JSON.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-port\fR \fI<P>\fR [default: 7979]
The app\*(Aqs control port or host:port
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBSOUNDCRAFT_CONTROL_PORT\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
One line of JSON instead of pretty\-printed
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIMETHOD\fR>
A control method or engine command id
.TP
[\fIJSON\fR]
Its parameters as JSON [default: {}]
